
@startuml UML状态图

title Campus Second-Hand Trading System - State Diagram

left to right direction
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam linetype polyline
skinparam nodesep 30
skinparam ranksep 45
skinparam ArrowColor #64748B

skinparam state {
    BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
    BorderColor #64748B
    FontColor #1E293B
    StartColor #475569
    EndColor #475569
}

state "Product Lifecycle" as Product {
    state "Draft" as P_Draft
    state "Pending Review" as P_Review
    state "On Shelf" as P_Sale
    state "Reserved" as P_Reserved
    state "Sold" as P_Sold
    state "Off Shelf" as P_Off
    state "Violation Removed" as P_Removed

    [*] --> P_Draft
    P_Draft --> P_Review : Submit
    P_Review --> P_Draft : Reject / Withdraw
    P_Review --> P_Sale : Approve

    P_Sale --> P_Reserved : Reservation created
    P_Reserved --> P_Sale : Reservation ended [eligible]
    P_Reserved --> P_Sold : Trade completed

    P_Sale --> P_Off : Seller takes down
    P_Off --> P_Sale : Relist [eligible]

    P_Sale --> P_Removed : Admin removes
    P_Removed --> P_Sale : Appeal approved [prior on shelf, eligible]
}

state "Reservation Lifecycle" as Reservation {
    state "Waiting for Seller" as R_Waiting
    state "Confirmed" as R_Confirmed
    state "Cancelled" as R_Cancelled
    state "Pending Admin" as R_Pending
    state "Completed" as R_Completed

    [*] --> R_Waiting : Reservation created
    R_Waiting --> R_Confirmed : Seller confirms
    R_Waiting --> R_Cancelled : Buyer cancels / seller account disabled
    R_Waiting --> [*] : Seller rejects (record policy TBD)

    R_Confirmed --> R_Completed : Buyer confirms trade
    R_Confirmed --> R_Cancelled : Both confirm no trade
    R_Confirmed --> R_Pending : Dispute [timeout met] / seller disabled

    R_Pending --> R_Cancelled : Admin voids
    R_Pending --> R_Confirmed : Admin keeps active
    R_Pending --> R_Completed : Admin confirms trade
}

Product -[hidden]right-> Reservation

note bottom of Product
  Product becomes available again only when
  review, account and other restrictions allow.
  Approved edits use a separate review process.
  Appeal recovery depends on the prior state.
end note

note bottom of Reservation
  Only one active reservation per product.
  Dispute timeout and seller-rejection
  record handling are not yet confirmed.
end note

@enduml
